    "description": "Title\n: Rock Collectible Lot Natural Amethyst Quartz Crystal Cluster Specimen Mineral\nDepartment\n: Collectibles & Art\nColor\n: Purple and gray\nCategory\n: Collectible Lots > Rocks/Artifacts Lot\nDescription\n: Discover the captivating beauty of this natural amethyst quartz crystal cluster, perfect for collectors and enthusiasts alike. This unique specimen features striking purple amethyst points rising from a matrix base, displaying both translucent and deep violet hues. The cluster showcases the natural formation and intricate crystal structure, making it a standout addition to any mineral collection or a stunning decorative display for your home or office. The durable stone offers long-lasting beauty and is easy to care for, giving you worry-free enjoyment. Amethyst is valued for its calming appearance and is often believed to promote positive energy. Each piece is carefully sourced to ensure authenticity, so you can buy with confidence knowing you are receiving a genuine mineral specimen. Whether you're a seasoned collector or new to geology, this amethyst cluster blends natural elegance with lasting value, and makes a thoughtful gift for anyone who appreciates Earth's treasures.\nSOME ITEMS CONTAIN AGE/WEAR/DAMAGE/STAINS\nSOLD AS IS\nSeguin\nNotes\nLOCAL PICK-UP IS NOW AVAILABLE.\nPLEASE CONTACT CUSTOMER SERVICE TO SCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT. YOU MUST MAKE AN APPOINTMENT FOR LOCAL PICK-UP ITEMS. LOCAL PICK-UP IS AVAILABLE MONDAY-FRIDAY 8am-4pm CST\nIF YOU HAVE ANY QUESTIONS PLEASE CONTACT OUR\nCUSTOMER SERVICE DEPARTMENT AT\n(726) 237-7616\nOR CLICK ON THE CUSTOMER SERVICE TAB IN SHOPGOODWILL.COM\nUsed Items Disclaimer\nThis is a pre-owned item and is being sold “AS IS ” If you have any questions concerning this item, feel free to contact us\nAll items (including new) are donated and may pick up dust/debris from warehouse – wash/clean before you wear/use\nWe describe our items to the best of our ability and try to incorporate as much research as possible with books and internet\nHowever, we are NOT experts in any field\nAll measurements for items are approximated\nGoodwill helps change lives\nthrough the power of work!\nThanks for shopping\nGoodwill Industries Of San Antonio!\nTerms of Sale\nOrders must be paid for within ten (10) days from the close of auction, unless other arrangements have been agreed upon.  All orders not paid within ten (10) days from the close of auction will be resold without further notice.",
